    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>strategy and Luck.</strong></h2>Try playing SoulTail.<br>Utilize various cards and their combinations to summon and nurture guardians, protecting the forest from menacing monsters.<br>Become the protector of the forest with the power of your strategy and luck!<br><br>\u25c6 Setting.<br>Place cards on the field to overpower the monsters.<br>The field consists of a fixed area and a combination area, through which you can strategize.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/d51d43b41c94702b6ac530c26c671c25.poster.avif?t=1713356591\" width=518 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/d51d43b41c94702b6ac530c26c671c25.webm?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/d51d43b41c94702b6ac530c26c671c25.mp4?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Card Combination.<br>Place cards in the combination area and combine them to summon and evolve guardians.<br>Guardians that reach a certain level can evolve and become even stronger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/5ed9e712731c054937e184425c7744a3.poster.avif?t=1713356591\" width=460 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/5ed9e712731c054937e184425c7744a3.webm?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/5ed9e712731c054937e184425c7744a3.mp4?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Drawing.<br>Keep drawing cards for better ones.<br>The higher the grade of the card, the better its performance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/1504036f776a4ccd51da1c128bb3d03b.poster.avif?t=1713356591\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/1504036f776a4ccd51da1c128bb3d03b.webm?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/1504036f776a4ccd51da1c128bb3d03b.mp4?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c6 Betting.<br>Use the betting system for your capital.<br>Guessing the color and number of the card drawn can earn you big rewards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/e2798ac4abde6799e1fe29751150fb99.poster.avif?t=1713356591\" width=762 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/e2798ac4abde6799e1fe29751150fb99.webm?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829630/extras/e2798ac4abde6799e1fe29751150fb99.mp4?t=1713356591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
